                                                "sense_id": "5c2b4726-df94-3a10-83bc-cc3c1c49988f",
                                                "text": "In a summation of changed times, we have a lost station site in Bournemouth (now occupied by a coach park) as well as its former hotel (still clinging on as apartments)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b07a7b4e-7079-3aeb-898b-c76f9c34f790",
